| Underscore emphasis marks to <it> tags
| This should be run after the general TXX -> SGM treatment.
| See also adidxi.ewt, which defines the inverse process.
| states: 1 = normal text
|   3 = inside a tag
|   4 = inside general (or unrecognized) end-tag
|   5 = inside word that, if foll'd by space, is last italicized
|   6 = inside extended italics
| Tags treated generally
<~<~1~3~
>~>~~1~
| emphasis
__~<it>~1~6~
_~<it>~1~5~
 _~ ~5~
|258_~|258~5~
_~~6~5~
 ~</it> ~5~1~
|258~</it>|258~5~1~
